SafariZone_SecretHouse_Text_AskEirikForWailer::
    .string "You made it to the SECRET HOUSE!\p"
    .string "Captain EIRIK of HAVORA GYM\n"
    .string "has a Wailmer Wailer for you.\p"
    .string "Defeat him to earn it. With the\n"
    .string "SOULBADGE, it lets you Surf.\p"
    .string "Some treasures here lie beyond\n"
    .string "the water. Come back prepared!$"

SafariZone_SecretHouse_Text_ExplainSurf::
    .string "With the SOULBADGE, face water\n"
    .string "and press A to use your Wailer.\p"
    .string "Step back onto shore to get off.\n"
    .string "No POKéMON needs to learn a move!$"
